{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00104","headline":"九月九日 · 高宗皇帝","name":"九月九日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端居临玉扆，初律啓金商。\n凤阙澄秋色，龙闱引夕凉。\n野净山气敛，林疎风露长。\n砌兰亏半影，岩桂发全香。\n满盖荷凋翠，圆花菊散黄。\n挥鞭争电烈，飞羽乱星光。\n柳空穿石碎，弦虚侧月张。\n怯猿啼落岫，惊雁断分行。\n斜轮低夕景，归斾拥通庄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}